The S proteins on the envelope of hepatitis B virus (HBV) are composed of the following components:

1) small protein (S protein, small protein), composed of $226$ amino acid residues;

2) middle protein (preS2+S protein, middle protein), composed of $281$ amino acid residues, including the small protein sequence and upstream $55$ amino acid residues;

3) large protein (preS1+preS2+S protein, large protein), composed of $389$ amino acid residues, including the middle protein sequence and upstream $108$ amino acid residues.

